ecome%20complete%20ordered%20correspondence%0A%20%2A%20columns.%20Excluded%20gaps%20have%20zero%20output%20width%3B%20the%20last%20row%20owns%20the%20end%0A%20%2A%20point.%20A%20proper%20byte%20contraction%20prevents%20fresh-plane%20non-consuming%20cycles.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20ranges%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20length%20%40returns%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%0A%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readGrammarSelectionIncludedRangePlan%28ranges%2C%20length%29%20%7B%0A%20%20if%20%28readGrammarSelectionIncludedRangeReservation%28length%2C%20ranges.length%2C%20false%29%20%3C%200%29%20return%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20const%20plan%20%3D%20%5B0%2C%200%2C%200%2C%200%5D%3B%0A%20%20let%20cursor%20%3D%200%2C%20output%20%3D%200%3B%0A%20%20for%20%28let%20index%20%3D%200%3B%20index%20%3C%20ranges.length%3B%20index%20%2B%3D%202%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20start%20%3D%20ranges%5Bindex%5D%20%3F%3F%20-1%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20end%20%3D%20ranges%5Bindex%20%2B%201%5D%20%3F%3F%20-1%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28%21acceptGrammarSelectionIncludedRangeSourceRange%28%27source-range%27%2C%20start%2C%20end%29%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%20start%20%3C%20cursor%20%7C%7C%20end%20%3E%20length%29%20return%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20%28cursor%20%3C%20start%29%20plan.push%28cursor%2C%20start%2C%20output%2C%20output%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20plan.push%28start%2C%20end%2C%20output%2C%20output%20%2B%20end%20-%20start%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20output%20%2B%3D%20end%20-%20start%3B%0A%20%20%20%20cursor%20%3D%20end%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20if%20%28output%20%3E%3D%20length%29%20return%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28cursor%20%3C%20length%29%20plan.push%28cursor%2C%20length%2C%20output%2C%20output%29%3B%0A%20%20plan.push%28length%2C%20length%2C%20output%2C%20output%29%3B%0A%20%20return%20plan%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Stream%20one%20gap%2C%20scalar%20copy%20or%20point%20from%20the%20validated%20complete%20plan.%0A%20%2A%20Width%20is%20measured%20by%20the%20existing%20decoder%20on%20actual%20parent%20bytes.%20Retur